Config Tuner (formerly Legend Tuner)
====================================

GRID™ Legends, GRID™ Autosport, Alien: Isolation™, Saints Row™, Sid Meier's
Railroads!, Hitman™, Lara Croft™ and Total War™ and their related marks are
trademarks of their respective owners. This is an unofficial tool and is not
affiliated with or endorsed by Feral Interactive, Electronic Arts, Codemasters,
2K, IO Interactive, Crystal Dynamics, Square Enix, Sega or Creative Assembly.
No game code, artwork, audio or save data is included in this repository.

The sanitized `preferences` samples in testdata/ are included solely to exercise
the XML parser and catalogue tests. They contain no personal identifiers and are
not game assets; provenance for each file is recorded in testdata/README.md.

